    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/b3b3345babb4b0443fd236453180dd78.avif?t=1707907439\" width=616 height=406 /></span><br><br>OcculThieves is a <strong>local competitive</strong> game for 2 to 4 players where your opponents are <strong>invisible</strong>. Keep an eye on each other's screens, <strong>cheating is the key to victory!</strong> Compete on 21 different maps and 3 game modes. <br><br><strong>Never let them see your next move coming!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/8d83b56ee8ea85d22f0e9dd75917dbc2.poster.avif?t=1707907439\" width=556 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/8d83b56ee8ea85d22f0e9dd75917dbc2.webm?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/8d83b56ee8ea85d22f0e9dd75917dbc2.mp4?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fun game for all types of players!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Easy to learn controls.<br></li><li> A tutorial to teach game mechanics to new players.<br></li><li> Gameplay based on observing several screens.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/81bd0cde0b115f0f43eaeb0890923eba.poster.avif?t=1707907439\" width=556 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/81bd0cde0b115f0f43eaeb0890923eba.webm?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/81bd0cde0b115f0f43eaeb0890923eba.mp4?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plenty of content to play with!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 7 environments with their own gameplay mechanics.<br></li><li> 3 unique game modes.<br></li><li> A 2 vs 2 team battle mode.<br></li><li> A random mode with various random effects each round.<br></li><li> A custom mode to create your own rules.<br></li><li> Plenty of other surprises!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/b3b3345babb4b0443fd236453180dd78.avif?t=1707907439\" width=616 height=406 /></span><br><br>OcculThieves is a <strong>local competitive</strong> game for 2 to 4 players where your opponents are <strong>invisible</strong>. Keep an eye on each other's screens, <strong>cheating is the key to victory!</strong> Compete on 21 different maps and 3 game modes. <br><br><strong>Never let them see your next move coming!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/8d83b56ee8ea85d22f0e9dd75917dbc2.poster.avif?t=1707907439\" width=556 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/8d83b56ee8ea85d22f0e9dd75917dbc2.webm?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/8d83b56ee8ea85d22f0e9dd75917dbc2.mp4?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fun game for all types of players!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Easy to learn controls.<br></li><li> A tutorial to teach game mechanics to new players.<br></li><li> Gameplay based on observing several screens.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/81bd0cde0b115f0f43eaeb0890923eba.poster.avif?t=1707907439\" width=556 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/81bd0cde0b115f0f43eaeb0890923eba.webm?t=1707907439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2643340/extras/81bd0cde0b115